<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E (The Securities and Exchange Ordinance, The Securities and Exchange Commission Act, and The Securities act are only a few of the significant regulations that have been introduced over time to secure the regulatory framework. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
