/E (Key Institutions of the Securities Market:)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
245 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (The securities market in Bangladesh is built in a structured network of institutions. They work together for ensuring market transparency, smooth operations and investor protection.It depends on a well-organized institutional framework in order to protect investor rights and ensure smooth operation. Though all participants work together to create a functional and reliable capital market, each participant plays a distinct role. Bangladesh Securities and Exchange Commission \(BSEC\) is at the center of this network which serves as the main regulatory body. The key institutions of the securities market are discussed below:)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [9 10]
>>
