/T (Brokers and Dealers: Brokers and dealers are known as the intermediaries. They execute trades and provide advisory services. They work as the bridge between investors and exchanges. They engage in the business of trading securities on behalf of the customers. They are regulated to ensure ethical conduct and safeguard investor interests.)
/E (Brokers and Dealers: Brokers and dealers are known as the intermediaries. They execute trades and provide advisory services. They work as the bridge between investors and exchanges. They engage in the business of trading securities on behalf of the customers. They are regulated to ensure ethical conduct and safeguard investor interests.)
