/T (Central Depository Bangladesh Limited \(CDBL\):  Central Depository Bangladesh Limited was established on 20 August 2000. It is a regulatory agency. It records and facilitates the trade of securities in Bangladesh. It is the National Numbering Agency for International Securities Identification Number in Bangladesh and member of the Association of National Numbering Agencies. Tapan Chowdhury is chairman of the board of directors. It is Bangladesh's only securities depository enterprise. It handles electronic clearing, settlement and safekeeping of securities.)
/E (Central Depository Bangladesh Limited \(CDBL\):  Central Depository Bangladesh Limited was established on 20 August 2000. It is a regulatory agency. It records and facilitates the trade of securities in Bangladesh. It is the National Numbering Agency for International Securities Identification Number in Bangladesh and member of the Association of National Numbering Agencies. Tapan Chowdhury is chairman of the board of directors. It is Bangladesh's only securities depository enterprise. It handles electronic clearing, settlement and safekeeping of securities.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1 2]
