/T (Supporting Institutions: Supporting institutions include credit rating agencies, financial advisors and legal and regulatory mechanisms etc. They also play a significant role in the smooth functioning of the securities market. Credit rating agencies provide independent assessments of issuers' creditworthiness which enables investors to make better decisions. Financial advisors assist investors in portfolio management, risk assessment and strategic investment planning. Legal frameworks and dispute resolution mechanisms ensure that contracts are enforceable and investor rights are protected.  )
