/T (Chapter-06: Critical Evaluation of The Securities Regulatory Framework and Challenges)
/E (Chapter-06: Critical Evaluation of The Securities Regulatory Framework and Challenges)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
395 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (The securities regulatory framework in Bangladesh has introduced modern laws and advanced trading systems, which help strengthen transparency, governance, market discipline as well as investor protection. Still, the framework suffers from several structural and operational challenges.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
396 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (1. Implementation Challenges: Although the legal framework is well-developed, limited manpower, lack of advanced technology, and slow administrative procedures limit its real impact.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
397 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (3. Quality of Initial Public Offerings \(IPOs\): Many weak companies, before entering secondary market, show high profits, but their performance declines soon after listing. This indicates that the approval process of IPOs by BSEC and the stock exchanges needs to be more careful and strict.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
398 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (4. Liquidity vs. Stability: Generally, the regulator focuses more on market stability than liquidity. Different measures like floor prices and circuit breakers protect investors from sudden losses. But, at the same time, they reduce trading activity and stop the spontaneous movement of prices in the market.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
399 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (5. Institutional Strengthening: Current "Retail-heavy" capital market needs stronger institutional investors such as mutual funds and pension funds.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
400 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (6. Small-Cap and SME Boards: The introduction of SME platforms is a positive step. But, small companies still face difficulties in regulatory requirements which  hinder the growth of SME segment in the capital market.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [7 8]
>>
endobj
401 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (To overcome these challenges, several steps are essential :)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
